            <ArticleTitle>Sexual headache and stroke in a heavy cannabis smoker.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>224-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sexual headaches usually develop during orgasm. Stroke complicating is rare. We report the case of a young man and heavy cannabis smoker who suffered posterior cerebral artery infarction during his first episode of coital headache.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
